    "platform_source_mechanism": "Android 6 Toybox names_to_pid compares two Bionic POSIX basename results in one strcmp; both point to the same thread-local output buffer. Matching a nonabsolute name therefore admits unrelated readable processes. pidof emits their space-separated PIDs and the single-PID guard rejects that output.",
